      <title>AMD显卡首次跑通英伟达DLSS 5：《赛博朋克2077》1080p仅30fps</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/AMD%E6%98%BE%E5%8D%A1%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%B7%91%E9%80%9A%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BEDLSS-5%E8%B5%9B%E5%8D%9A%E6%9C%8B%E5%85%8B20771080p%E4%BB%8530fps/</link>
